  "notes": "Take-off, stay low at 1,000 feet. Descend to 500 feet above water, then flyover Monas at 300 feet, left of the Monas. Fly straight for a few seconds, then start a left turn and climb to 800 feet. Small right turn to overfly runway. Turn to the right to 240 degrees into a holding pattern. Exit holding pattern to the right, heading North to Monas. Turn right 90 degrees and overly Monas at 800 feet. Finally a right turn to the runway, overfly it and land in wingman formation",
